From 671a0ac8247711de968db1a283a0132c2924f2cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus V2 Builder <builder@lotus.org>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:58:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] perf(v2): single-pass V2 tx decode/hash, parallel pre-cs_main
 batch decode, and pure v7 coinbases

Fuse V2 v7 transaction wire decoding with BLAKE3 TxId/TxHash computation
in a single pass, decode raw transaction batches in parallel prior to
cs_main acquisition, and emit native v7 coinbase transactions.
